  "description": {
    "text": "The 2022 Pokémon World Championships, held from 18 to 21 August 2022 at ExCeL London, the first since the 2020 and 2021 events were canceled during the COVID-19 pandemic. Competitors got the last Champions Festival, its art showing Big Ben and the London Eye; staff got a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing, up to Champion.\n\nThe top four of each age division received No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer trophy cards, the last with the full-art picture first used in 2014.",
